"nav_title":"","bg_color":"#edf2f9","card_bg":"#ffffff","heading_color":"#01132f","accent_color":"#1c80fe","mobile_scroll":true,"heading":"What’s Included"}},"spec_table":{"type":"product-spec-table","blocks":{"s1":{"type":"row","settings":{"panel":"left","label":"Fit","value":"One Size (Adjustable)"}},"s2":{"type":"row","settings":{"panel":"left","label":"Materials","value":"Nylon, Polyester Mesh, TPU"}},"s3":{"type":"row","settings":{"panel":"left","label":"Weight (vest only)","value":"38.5 oz (1092 g)"}},"s4":{"type":"row","settings":{"panel":"left","label":"Water Capacity","value":"Approx. ：200-380ML"}},"s5":{"type":"row","settings":{"panel":"left","label":"Input Power","value":"5V \/ 3A"}},"s6":{"type":"row","settings":{"panel":"left","label":"Port","value":"USB-A"}},"row_yGxhVt":{"type":"row","settings":{"panel":"left","label":"User Manual","value":"<a href=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0457\/1099\/9709\/files\/Venustas-Cooling-Vest-User-Manual.pdf?v=1782974417\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#297ce2; text-decoration:underline;\">Download<\/a>"}},"s7":{"type":"row","settings":{"panel":"right","icon":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/icon3.png","label":"Dual Cooling (Ice-water + Fans)","value":"High 5H, Low 6H"}},"s8":{"type":"row","settings":{"panel":"right","icon":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/icon1_5c6cd358-9fc9-441e-8a2e-0a8674835fc9.png","label":"Fans Only","value":"High 6H, Low 7H"}},"s9":{"type":"row","settings":{"panel":"right","icon":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/icon2.png","label":"Water-cooling","value":"High 23H, Low 29H"}}},"block_order":["s1","s2","s3","s4","s5","s6","row_yGxhVt","s7","s8","s9"],"name":"Spec Table","settings":{"enabled_section_child_scroll":false,"section_scroll_nav":"","nav_title":"","bg_color":"#edf2f9","panel_bg":"#ffffff","accent_color":"#1c80fe","heading_color":"#01132f","heading":"Specs","left_heading":"Specification","left_heading_2":"","right_heading":"Mode","right_heading_2":"Runtime*","right_footnote":"*Runtime may vary based on battery capacity, ice temperature, ambient temperature, and usage."}},"care_icons":{"type":"product-care-cards","blocks":{"cc1":{"type":"care_card","settings":{"icon":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/cv-icon1.png","title":"Easy to Maintain","description":"Drain, rinse & air-dry — easy to keep fresh."}},"cc2":{"type":"care_card","settings":{"icon":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/cv-icon2.png","title":"Safety First","description":"Runs on low 5V power with waterproof plug seals."}},"cc3":{"type":"care_card","settings":{"icon":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/cv-icon3.png","title":"Care Instructions","description":"Wipe clean only. No machine wash. <strong style=\"color: #1C80FE;\">Never soak.<\/strong>"}},"cc4":{"type":"care_card","settings":{"icon":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/cv-icon4.png","title":"Ice Pack Tips","description":"Refreeze ice packs & rotate for longer cooling."}}},"block_order":["cc1","cc2","cc3","cc4"],"settings":{"bg_color":"#edf2f9","card_bg":"#ffffff","heading_color":"#01132f","subheading_color":"#46566a","title_color":"#01132f","desc_color":"#5a6470","accent_color":"#1c80fe","heading":"Care","subheading":"","mobile_scroll":true,"disclaimer":"Not waterproof — keep out of rain and deep water. The elderly, children, pregnant women, and those with heart conditions should avoid prolonged low-temperature use. Stop use if you notice leaks, overheating, or abnormal lights."}},"faqs":{"type":"product-faqs-section","blocks":{"f1":{"type":"FAQ","settings":{"heading":"How is this different from a regular fan cooling vest?","body":"<p>Fan vests only move air and depend on sweat evaporating, so they lose effectiveness in high heat and humidity. This vest circulates ice water against your back to cool you by direct contact regardless of humidity — with fans adding airflow on top.<\/p>"}},"faq_9nVN3z":{"type":"FAQ","settings":{"heading":"Why not just use ice packs?","body":"<p>Ice packs cool one spot temporarily. Our vest continuously circulates cold water across your back  while you stay active — built for long shifts, outdoor work, and hands-free cooling.<\/p>"}},"f2":{"type":"FAQ","settings":{"heading":"How long does it stay cold?","body":"<p>The cold comes from the ice, not the battery. A set of reusable ice packs gives about 1 hour of strong cooling; a frozen 350ml bottle about 1.5 hours. Refreeze and swap in fresh ice packs for all-day cooling, and the fans keep airflow going the whole time.<\/p>"}},"faq_bgFzwP":{"type":"FAQ","settings":{"heading":"Does the cooling effect disappear quickly in 100°F+ weather?","body":"<p>Not at all. In extremely hot environments, the vest naturally absorbs more heat, so the cooling sensation may gradually become less noticeable over time. However, that's because it's actively drawing heat away from your body. Rather than creating cold air like an air conditioner, the vest is designed to slow heat buildup, reduce heat stress, and help you stay comfortable longer during outdoor work, hiking, sports, and other activities in hot weather.<\/p>"}},"faq_mfTKNb":{"type":"FAQ","settings":{"heading":"Can I refill the vest on the go?","body":"<p>Yes. Simply add more ice and water whenever needed. Ice availability at convenience stores, gas stations, and rest stops makes it easy to refresh your cooling during long outdoor activities.<\/p>"}},"f3":{"type":"FAQ","settings":{"heading":"Can I use a regular power bank?","body":"<p>Yes — it runs on any 5V USB power bank. The Kit includes the Venustas 5000mAh battery (USB-A); for Vest Only, use that battery or any 5V\/10000mAh bank.<\/p>"}},"faq_UGKVbC":{"type":"FAQ","settings":{"heading":"Can I wear clothing over the Cooling Vest?","body":"<p>Yes. You can wear clothing over the Cooling Vest. However, additional layers may restrict airflow to the fans. For the best performance, we recommend turning off the Airflow Fans and using Ice-Water Circulation only.<\/p>"}},"f4":{"type":"FAQ","settings":{"heading":"Will it make my shirt wet?","body":"<p>Light surface condensation is normal in humid heat. Wear a thin base layer underneath and avoid aiming the cold directly at bare skin for long periods.<\/p>"}},"f5":{"type":"FAQ","settings":{"heading":"Can I wear it in the rain?","body":"<p>No. It’s not waterproof — keep the main unit out of rain and deep water.<\/p>"}},"faq_diWYbx":{"type":"FAQ","settings":{"heading":"What size is it?","body":"<p>One size fits all, with adjustable shoulder, chest, and waist buckles.<\/p>"}},"faq_EAUxH4":{"type":"FAQ","settings":{"heading":"How heavy is it?","body":"<p>The vest weighs 38.5 oz (1092 g) empty; the battery adds 6.56 oz (186 g).<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["f1","faq_9nVN3z","f2","faq_bgFzwP","faq_mfTKNb","f3","faq_UGKVbC","f4","f5","faq_diWYbx","faq_EAUxH4"],"name":"FAQs Section","settings":{"enabled_section_child_scroll":false,"section_scroll_nav":"","nav_title":"FAQs","heading":"Frequently Asked Questions"}},"in_the_field":{"type":"product-in-the-field","blocks":{"p1":{"type":"photo","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/cv-ugc-or-3.jpg","alt":"Cooling vest in the field"}},"p2":{"type":"photo","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/5_6b6b4623-fe85-4695-b6ad-c3678357a218.jpg","alt":"Cooling vest in the field"}},"p3":{"type":"photo","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/3_ffa0390e-eb1e-4288-ac51-b4a16f0fb485.jpg","alt":"Cooling vest in the field"}},"p5":{"type":"photo","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/cv-ugc-or-1.jpg","alt":"Cooling vest in the field"}},"photo_6fRA7k":{"type":"photo","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/13_5966b705-4037-4444-a03d-fec046ea783a.jpg","alt":""}},"photo_MG7MRM":{"type":"photo","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/15_3b48e46a-ca6f-4533-a200-42aba30f8c54.jpg","alt":""}},"photo_JNmnrW":{"type":"photo","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/cv-ugc-or-2.jpg","alt":""}},"photo_we3qYJ":{"type":"photo","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/12_ca5cbc0d-96fa-4f55-9e38-c011daeff365.jpg","alt":""}},"photo_pjALzG":